SECTION 1 — LEARNING OBJECTIVES

Teach Gravitation from beginner level to JEE Main and JEE Advanced readiness.

The student should be able to:

1. Apply Newton’s universal law of gravitation.
2. Calculate gravitational force between objects.
3. Understand gravitational field and acceleration due to gravity.
4. Calculate gravitational potential and potential energy.
