SECTION 1 — LEARNING OBJECTIVES

Teach the chapter from beginner level to JEE Main and JEE Advanced readiness.

The student should be able to:

1. Understand fluid pressure and its variation with depth.
2. Apply Pascal’s law and hydraulic-machine principles.
