Water has surface tension 0.072 N/m and density 1000 kg/m³. It rises in a tube of radius 0.0005 m. Take g = 10 m/s² and assume θ = 0°.

h = 2(0.072)/(1000 × 10 × 0.0005).

h = 0.0288 m = 2.88 cm.

